\u003e are typically lighter to accommodate onboard batteries and improve portability.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eYou can learn more about how this affects real-world performance in our guide to \u003ca href=\"/blog/corded-vs-cordless-robotic-pool-cleaners\"\u003ecorded vs cordless robotic pool cleaners\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eFinal Thoughts\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eUltimately, robotic pool cleaner weight should not be considered in isolation. It works in combination with motor strength, brush design, and navigation logic. Paying attention to weight helps set realistic expectations and can prevent common ownership frustrations. When chosen correctly, a well-balanced robot feels effective in the water and manageable out of it.\u003c/p\u003e"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"3:[[[\"$\",\"link\",\"0\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/css/d071dca61fbb01bf.css\",\"precedence\":\"next\",\"crossOrigin\":\"\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"1\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/css/0fc6c400c3ed5371.css\",\"precedence\":\"next\",\"crossOrigin\":\"\"}]],[\"$\",\"$L4\",null,{\"buildId\":\"Vf2Pq8-h8bQThAI7uUmXj\",\"assetPrefix\":\"\",\"initialCanonicalUrl\":\"/blog/robotic-pool-cleaner-weight-why-it-matters\",\"initialTree\":[\"\",{\"children\":[\"blog\",{\"children\":[[\"slug\",\"robotic-pool-cleaner-weight-why-it-matters\",\"d\"],{\"children\":[\"__PAGE__?{\\\"slug\\\":\\\"robotic-pool-cleaner-weight-why-it-matters\\\"}\",{}]}]}]},\"$undefined\",\"$undefined\",true],\"initialHead\":[false,\"$L5\"],\"globalErrorComponent\":\"$6\",\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"html\",null,{\"lang\":\"en\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"body\",null,{\"className\":\"d-flex flex-column min-vh-100\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"nav\",null,{\"className\":\"navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-light bg-light\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"container\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L7\",null,{\"href\":\"/\",\"className\":\"navbar-brand d-flex align-